# The sdist ships the test suite (setuptools picks up tests/test*.py on its own),
# so it has to ship everything that suite imports — conftest.py, and the shared
# fakes the terminal tests drive. Without this the tarball contains 39 test
# modules that cannot even be collected, which `reproduce.yml` in tool-market
# caught by unpacking the release and running it.
recursive-include tests *.py
